og and resolution times suggest potential capacity issues.\n\n**Recommendation**:\n- Evaluate team capacity and consider hiring or redistributing workload to balance team efforts and improve efficiency.\n\n## General Recommendations\n- **Data Tracking**: Improve data tracking for velocity and other key metrics to enable comprehensive analysis.\n- **Process Improvement**: Regularly review and refine processes to enhance efficiency and reduce ticket resolution times.\n- **Resource Management**: Ensure adequate resource allocation to maintain a sustainable workload and prevent burnout."
